OL,3,GNEWSAFire sweeps through former theatre
OL,4,Aand town hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire has broken out at a former
OL,7,Ftheatre and town hall on the Isle of
OL,8,FWight with flames seen raging through
OL,9,Fits upper-floor windows.
OL,11,FFirefighters from across the island
OL,12,Fhave been tackling the blaze on Lind
OL,13,FStreet in Ryde after it broke out about
OL,14,F23:30 BST.
OL,16,FHampshire & Isle of Wight Fire & Rescue
OL,17,FService said the fire, that had spread
OL,18,Fto the roof, was now under control with
OL,19,Fcrews from Cowes and East Cowes
OL,20,Fmonitoring the building and dampening
OL,21,Fdown remaining hotspots.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
